{"date":"2025-12-17","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_e1b0cdd23f0c0c3075532f9313be0c20","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1765963800,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-12-14","chunk":0,"id":"m_f1404a53e3c8161505d0563a96221c41"}}},{"id":"m_bf7557a748a883994e96cbf2b523cff7","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1765963837,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_15897d038573fdef17e36ffdad433b9d","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1765963874,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4e93a6ba2c2e0bda973a7898c18b3ff0","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1765963911,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_a7107382de8a6efe500e289f212ba4d9","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1765963948,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_05475630358512204354255ee1b86cc8","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1765963985,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1d727d180de86734258b32ac19a20140","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1765964022,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_d7ca2892b59288059cfcdd108fc93c7a","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1765964059,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ef1fb78da715ba5d917bf0b7045856ae","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1765964096,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_207927330b60318b8bd5e2b7d7b14798","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1765964133,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_8585edf886b0881e3ad53f48c26c8ea7","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1765964170,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_6966def4cc0aa5245ab2de9864966dd3","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1765964207,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_a997301105c5b7edd03ca06ab1286136","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1765964244,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_f8140acb31b6c6432f1ddbc287277da7","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1765964281,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6b4b9e99933096381e395cc8554a4725","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1765964318,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_12b2b8780ab9331542b4a8b4ffd69ecb","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1765964355,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_d1dcd7b1aef9b4f19540a355a2f423be","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1765964392,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_9ea850ec8c18130902208ef2e639160b","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1765964429,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_afc53ed133eadcc15586e0246b57ddcb","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1765964466,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_51f885cc633c92432b07c52d16d58892","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1765964503,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5d9298c136c8613219fe0525ea313848","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1765964540,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_27c5908380751df85374c362d1b9ea40","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1765964577,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_32419a586e842fb42f643d2c76610628","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1765964614,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_687c1b0c81dced01de640545e7bd5f25","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1765964651,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
